---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Refund & Cancellation Policy | RegPulse Regulatory Intelligence"
  description="Clear, transparent 7-day refund policy and 1-click subscription cancellation terms for RegPulse Bulk Catalog Passes and Watchlist Radar subscriptions."
  canonicalPath="/refund/"
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-sm space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-teal-700">Billing &amp; Guarantees</p>
        <h1 id="main-content" tabindex="-1" class="mt-1 text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-950">Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy</h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-500">Effective Date: November 26, 2026</p>
      </div>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-950">1. 7-Day Satisfaction Guarantee</h2>
        <p>
          If a Bulk Catalog Pre-Flight Pass ($19 one-time) or initial Watchlist Radar subscription ($29/mo or $79/mo) does not meet your compliance workflow expectations, email <a href="mailto:hachileviathan@gmail.com?subject=%5BRegPulse%20Refund%20Request%5D" class="text-teal-700 font-semibold underline">hachileviathan@gmail.com</a> within <strong>7 calendar days of purchase</strong> with your order receipt email for a full 100% refund—no hurdles or sales calls required.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-950">2. Self-Serve Subscription Cancellation</h2>
        <p>
          Monthly Watchlist Radar Pro and Agency subscriptions may be canceled anytime directly from your billing receipt link (Creem customer portal) or by email prior to the next renewal date. Upon cancellation, your alerts remain active through the end of your current paid billing period, and no further renewals will be charged.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-950">3. Processing Timelines</h2>
        <p>
          Approved refunds are initiated within 2 business days via our Merchant of Record back to your original payment method. Depending on your card issuer, funds typically settle within 3–7 business days.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
